  "contentHtml": "<p>교육부에서 주관하는 간담회에</p><p>저희 재과만이 초청 받았습니다!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2754b1415d66c555fb6e23333eefea48b7ff0079\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2754b1415d66c555fb6e23333eefea48b7ff0079\" data-origin-width=\"620\" data-origin-height=\"574\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>1만 9천명 재과만 회원님들께 여쭙니다.</p><p><span style=\"color: #202124; background-color: #f1f3f4;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">재과만 선생님들이 꿈꾸는 수업이 정책으로 실현될 수 있도록, </span></p><p><span style=\"color: #202124; background-color: #f1f3f4;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">현장의 현실과 필요한 지원을 가감 없이 말씀해 주십시오!&#160;&#160;</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>설문 링크 :&#160;</b></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b><a href=\"https://forms.gle/JPLC43HP8p5cVPD59\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://forms.gle/JPLC43HP8p5cVPD59</a></b></span></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"재과만, 현장과학교육의 목소리를 담다!\" data-og-description=\"1만 9천명 재과만 회원님들의 목소리를 담겠습니다!\" data-og-host=\"docs.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://forms.gle/JPLC43HP8p5cVPD59\" data-og-url=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdxGpX0G3LInEu0RB7eoCycv-xtBdp5yMuWff5V5L0RMXS1iA/viewform?usp=send_form&amp;usp=embed_facebook\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/ncc1n/hyZODw8y3E/d6V7UzqDg4VCMPRNxNKkh1/img.png?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/KAtuH/hyZPfJl9Ce/9D07IoawqIrJd1XKlPZORK/img.png?width=1052&amp;height=526&amp;face=0_0_1052_526,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cCYysO/hyZPa2l4Y6/sjnkOly33ihBWFjJMxL1dK/img.jpg?width=696&amp;height=714&amp;face=0_0_696_714\"><a href=\"https://forms.gle/JPLC43HP8p5cVPD59\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://forms.gle/J